{{#if tasks}}
## Tasks

You have access to a task list on the `tasks` object. Use `{{api.tasks.add_task.call}}` to add
work, `{{api.tasks.update_task.call}}` to update a task's data, `{{api.tasks.complete_task.call}}` to mark a
task as completed, and `{{api.tasks.remove_task.call}}` to drop a task. At most
{{tasks.maxTasks}} may be recorded.

Tasks are required to form a directed acyclic graph. You may record task
dependencies when adding a task or with `{{api.tasks.set_blocked_by.call}}`. Cycles will be
automatically rejected.
{{/if}}

